#: rc.cpp:205
msgid ""
"DHT is a trackerless protocol to find peers sharing the same torrents as you "
"do."
msgstr ""
"VPT is en Protokoll ahn Tracker, över dat sik Partners finnen laat, de de "
"sülven Torrents as Du daallaadt."

